Patch for Andrej Karpathy's nanochat enabling bit-for-bit equivalence testing
against nanochat-repro. Applies to nanochat commit 92d63d4e8bb4df75c3b71618f31ddde2378b2bcd.

Contents: determinism settings (fixed seeds, deterministic algorithms, FA3 and
torch.compile disabled), high-precision loss/BPB/CORE logging, checkpoint MD5
printing, SFT step-accounting fixes, and test_equivalence_*.sh harnesses.

Apply from the nanochat repo root with:
  git apply nanochat_equivalence.patch

